  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming China&apos;s cooling sector for low-carbon development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to lay the groundwork for leveraging technical innovation to go beyond China#s achievements so far in pursuing low carbon and sustainable air conditioners (ACs), taking progress towards #net zero# and conservation of materials to the next level. The proposed project is composed of three outcomes that work together to promote uptake of transformative technical innovation across the AC lifecycle.</narrative>
  </description>
